.TH tine-open 1  "open " 
.SH NAME
tine\-open \- Open a graph in the desktop app
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine open\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIGRAPH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open a graph in the desktop app
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIGRAPH\fR>

